's testimony across time.", "w02": "凌晨四点的城市陷入深沉的寂静。霓虹灯已暗淡，街道空荡荡的。高楼大厦的窗户漆黑一片，只有偶尔一两扇亮着昏黄的灯光。清洁工推着三轮车缓缓前行，脚步声回荡在无人的街角。天空泛起鱼肚白，远处传来晨鸟的啼鸣。这个时刻，城市似乎在屏住呼吸，等待黎明的到来。夜班工人疲惫地打着哈欠，而普通人还在梦乡里。城市的心脏暂时停止跳动。", "w03": "• A function is a recipe that solves the same problem over and over—instead of writing the same steps many times, you write them once and ask for them whenever you need them.\n• Recursion is when a function asks itself the same question but with a simpler version of the problem—like asking a smaller question each time until you reach an answer you already know.\n• Example: to count down from 10, you say the number, then ask yourself to count down from 9—and keep doing this until you reach 0 and stop."}
